GSQ-RCO GGUF release changes by UkisAI:
  - Swift Flash Next weights converted to mixed-precision GGUF, with
    reused ISTA-DASLab allocation profiles and Swift-specific refinement.
  - Weights split into two GGUF shards per tier; BF16 vision projector included.
  - Quantization metadata, evaluation records and an adapted README added.
